"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 18번","searchText":" 18\n\n전압확대비가 , 저항이 10Ω, 인덕턴스가\n\n0.2mH인 직렬회로가 공진상태일 때, 정전용량\npF는?\n\n\n① 10          ② 20\n\n③ 30          ④ 40\n\n⑤ 50","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m18","number":18},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m18-q.webp","width":696,"height":629},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m18-e1.webp","width":696,"height":936}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q19","number":19,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 19번","searchText":" 19\n\n전원이 Y, 부하가 △로 접속된 회로에서 전원의 상전압이\n\nV, 부하 한 상의 임피던스가 Ω일 때, 부\n하로 공급되는 선전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m19","number":19},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m19-q.webp","width":678,"height":689},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m19-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1432}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q20","number":20,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 20번","searchText":" 20\n\n송전단의 전압이 5500V, 수전단의 전압이 5000V이며,\n\n무부하시의 수전단 전압이 5125V이다. 전압 강하율을 \n\n, 전압 변동률을 라 할 때, 는?\n\n\n① 5           ② 7.5\n\n③ 12.5         ④ 15\n\n⑤ 17.5","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m20","number":20},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m20-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m20-e1.webp","width":678,"height":450},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m20-e2.webp","width":696,"height":765}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q21","number":21,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 21번","searchText":" 21\n\n영상분 전압을 , 정상분 전압을 , 역상분 전압을 \n라 할 때, ‘’의 관계가 성립되는 사고의\n\n종류는? (단, 는 상수이다.)\n\n\n① 1선 지락사고     ② 2선 지락사고\n\n③ 선간 단락사고④ 3상 단락사고\n\n⑤ 단선 사고","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m21","number":21},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m21-q.webp","width":678,"height":551},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m21-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1119}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q22","number":22,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 22번","searchText":" 22\n\n다음 내용의 빈 칸에 들어갈 말로 옳은 것은?\n\n 동일한 두 금속을 접합하여 전류를 흘리면 각 접합점에\n\n 서 열의 흡수와 열의 발생이 일어나는 현상을 ( ㉠   )\n\n 이라 하고, 다른 두 금속을 접합하여 전류를 흘릴 때\n\n 열의 흡수와 열의 발생이 일어나는 현상을 ( ㉡  )이\n\n 라 한다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠  : 펠티에 효과,   ㉡  : 톰슨 효과\n\n② ㉠  : 톰슨 효과,    ㉡  : 펠티에 효과\n\n③ ㉠  : 제벡 효과,    ㉡  : 펠티에 효과\n\n④ ㉠  : 펠티에 효과,   ㉡  : 제벡 효과\n\n⑤ ㉠  : 홀 효과,     ㉡  : 근접 효과","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m22","number":22},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m22-q.webp","width":696,"height":958},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m22-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1051}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q23","number":23,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 23번","searchText":" 23\n\n다음 그림과 같이 단상 전력계 2개를 이용하여 3상 부하\n\n의 전력을 측정하고자 한다. 각 전력계의 지시값이 300\n\nW, 600W일 때, 부하에서의 3상 소비전력W은?\n\n\n\n\n\n①           ② \n\n③           ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m23","number":23},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m23-q.webp","width":696,"height":924},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m23-e1.webp","width":678,"height":831}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q24","number":24,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 24번","searchText":" 24\n\n설비용량이 575kW인 수용가 A와 325kW인 B수용가가\n\n있다. 두 수용가의 수용률은 모두 80이며, 합성최대수\n\n요전력이 600kW라고 할 때, 수용가 간의 부등률은?\n\n\n① 1.1          ② 1.2\n\n③ 1.3          ④ 1.4\n\n⑤ 1.5","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m24","number":24},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m24-q.webp","width":678,"height":643},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m24-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P039-S1-Q25","number":25,"question":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노) · 객관식 25번","searchText":" 25\n\nkW의 3상 부하에 단상 변압기 2대를 이용하여\n\n전력을 공급하고자 한다. 부하의 역률이 0.8인 경우, 전력공\n\n급에 필요한 단상 변압기의 용량은 몇 kVA 인가?\n\n①           ② \n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h1","collectionLabel":"2024 상반기","examLabel":"24.06.08 한국공항공사 (휴노)","originalId":"2024h1-e18-m25","number":25},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m25-q.webp","width":678,"height":653},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h1-e18-m25-e1.webp","width":678,"height":914}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]}]}
